      "writtenOn": "2026-10-19T14:02:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just to confirm this function doesn\u0027t exist yet right? I\u0027m trying to think about for these various tests where it makes sense to pass in an SkBackendSelection enum or not. I think we want the default (i.e. no enum passed in) to be kAutomatic (though is there a good enough argument to not support a default and require clients to pass in kAutomatic)? Regardless I just want to make sure these test are trying to test the kAutomatic code path when checking Recorder type vs explicitly wanting to for cpu via kCpu",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 109,
        "startChar": 48,
        "endLine": 109,
        "endChar": 60
      },
      "revId": "c3582ed28a014697d4cf85e09ae4c7072408a134",
